              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پرنده ها زمستان را در تالاب میگذرانند. Parande-hâ zemestân râ dar tâlâb migozarânand. The birds spend the winter in the wetland."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Iran's wetlands are winter homes for many birds from the north."
            }
          ]
