              "text": "جاری شدن (jâri shodan) — \"to flow, to run (of water)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بعد از باران آب در جوب جاری شد. Ba'd az bârân âb dar jub jâri shod. After the rain water ran in the gutter."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "jâri 'flowing' + shodan. Âb-e jâri — running water."
            }
          ]
        },
